  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Global Programme on Strengthening the Rule of Law, Human Rights, Justice and Security for Sustainable Peace and Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to address the myriad of persisting challenges that inhibit access to justice for the vulnerable, particularly women, girls, youth, persons with disabilities who suffer violence sexual and gender-based violence (SGBV) and human rights abuses and violations with impunity. It further seeks to support victims of prolonged arbitrary detention as a result of inordinate delays in the administration of justice.</narrative>
  </description>
